Why the title? Sorry if this is common knowledge, but my thoughts are
that Valkyries are probably the most likely characters to ascend.

They get Mjollnir.  They get Vorpal Blade. I would argue this is the
best combination there is, and if this isn't enough they get the Orb of
Fate.

Dealing with the undead/gremlins (after I got wise),
invisible-moat-types, and  cockatrices might have been a problem.  But
Mjollnir makes dealing with these easy.  Just stand back and throw.

The level teleport special power of the Orb came in useful when
transporting treasure out of gehenom, but the ^ sensing power was
essential in the end levels.


